          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.55.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 55:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were ma miyo ji kodhi ma cwoyo, kodi cemo acama, bino miyo win kodhi ma wiyenyo to miyo kodhi no dongo, ŋey gima wok i tim mewin mabeyo wonyak kweth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bino miyo wiŋaŋ i kisi gimoro ŋey winyal bedo jomiyo ndir je, aka jomathoth jobino foyo Were ro mic mewin ma bino luwo gi bongi wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole tic ma witiyo me kikony candi pa ji maleŋ pa Were kende, to bende miyo ji kweth jofoyo Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ro tic mewin m'otieko nyuthere kamaler me, jomathoth jobino miyo Were dwoŋ ro cwirok mewin kwoŋ Wac Manyen Maber mapa Kristo ma wituco ni wiyeyo, kodi ro miyo kony mewin munyo wipoko lim mewin gi jo kodi joman bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno, jobino kwayo riwin gi maro madwoŋ rupiri Were otieko nyutho win nema madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were wofoy ro mic pere ma welo mere kiwacere!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
